<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>AWS Boot Camp - ItTechGenie</title>
    <link href="~/lib/bootstrap/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link href="~/css/site.css" rel="stylesheet" />

    <!-- Custom Styles -->
    <style>
        .hero-section {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 60px 0;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .hero-section h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            color: #343a40;
        }

        .hero-section p {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            color: #6c757d;
        }

        .session-heading {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: #007bff;
            margin-top: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .contact-section {
            background-color: #e9ecef;
            padding: 40px;
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        .contact-section a {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            color: #007bff;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .lab-session {
            background-color: #f1f3f5;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .lab-session ul {
            list-style-type: none;
            padding-left: 0;
        }

        .lab-session ul li {
            padding: 5px 0;
        }

        .btn-join {
            background-color: #28a745;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        /* Responsive styles */
        @@media (max-width: 767px) {
            .hero-section h1 {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <!-- Header Section -->
    <header class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark bg-dark fixed-top">
        <div class="container-fluid">
            <a class="navbar-brand d-flex align-items-center" href="/">
                <img src="~/images/logo-placeholder.png" alt="Logo" width="40" height="40" class="me-2" />
                ItTechGenie
            </a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <div class="container-fluid" style="margin-top: 56px;">
        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <div class="hero-section">
            <h1>Join Our Exclusive AWS Boot Camp!</h1>
            <p>Learn AWS from industry experts in this comprehensive 3-day boot camp. Perfect for beginners and professionals!</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Boot Camp Overview -->
        <section>
            <h2>Trainer: Ram (15+ Years of Experience as a Tech Lead)</h2>
            <p>This boot camp is designed to give you the essential AWS skills through hands-on labs and real-world applications.</p>

            <h2 class="session-heading">Day 1: Vitals of AWS Core Services</h2>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Session 1:</strong> Overview of AWS - Cloud Computing, AWS Benefits, Infrastructure</li>
                <li><strong>Session 2:</strong> Identity & Access Management - IAM Best Practices, Roles, Policies</li>
                <li><strong>Session 3:</strong> EC2 & Compute Services - EC2, Lambda, Elastic Beanstalk</li>
                <li class="lab-session">
                    <strong>Lab Activity:</strong>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Launch EC2 Instances & Configure Security Groups</li>
                        <li>Set Up IAM Roles & Policies</li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
            </ul>

            <h2 class="session-heading">Day 2: Storage, Databases, and Networking</h2>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Session 1:</strong> AWS Storage Services - S3, EBS, EFS, Data Transfer</li>
                <li><strong>Session 2:</strong> AWS Database Services - RDS, DynamoDB, Redshift</li>
                <li><strong>Session 3:</strong> Networking & Content Delivery - VPC, Route 53, CloudFront</li>
                <li class="lab-session">
                    <strong>Lab Activity:</strong>
                    <ul>
                        <li>S3 Bucket Creation & File Upload</li>
                        <li>VPC with Public & Private Subnets</li>
                        <li>Launching RDS Instances</li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
            </ul>

            <h2 class="session-heading">Day 3: Security, Monitoring, and Automation Deployment</h2>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Session 1:</strong> AWS Security - KMS, Secrets Manager, AWS Inspector</li>
                <li><strong>Session 2:</strong> Monitoring & Logging - CloudWatch, CloudTrail, VPC Flow Logs</li>
                <li><strong>Session 3:</strong> Automation - CloudFormation, Systems Manager</li>
                <li class="lab-session">
                    <strong>Lab Activity:</strong>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Creating CloudWatch Alarms for EC2</li>
                        <li>Deploying CloudFormation Stacks</li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Contact Section -->
        <div class="contact-section">
            <h3>Limited to 40 participants per batch. Register now!</h3>
            <a href="https://t.me/+GBYH0VFX9IgyNmRl" class="btn-join">Join Telegram Group</a>
            <p>Contact Us: +917676371573</p>
            <p>Demo Link: <a href="https://youtu.be/GnRhQZQbwcI">Watch Demo</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="~/lib/bootstrap/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>

</html>
